                <h1 class="c-banner__header" data-swiftype-name="title" data-swiftype-type="string">How To Avoid Vendor Lock In&#x200B;</h1>

                <h2 class="c-banner__sub-header">4 Simple Steps</h2>



                <div class="c-banner__social">
                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?title=How&#x2B;To&#x2B;Avoid&#x2B;Vendor&#x2B;Lock&#x2B;In%e2%80%8b&mini=true&summary=&url=https://www.escode.com/resources/how-to-avoid-vendor-lock-in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="c-banner__social-item">
